    narr:narration """On 2026-08-21, DaveQuantum announced a decided switch of the analytics pipeline from PostgreSQL to QuantumDB, framed as a declared decision rather than a statement of fact [switch announcement](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1787304049763_1). The rationale rests on two stated benefits: [10x query performance and lower licensing cost](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1787304049763_2), reinforced by editorial summary bullets restating the [migration direction](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1787304049763_3) and [performance gain](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1787304049763_4). A concrete timeline commitment of Q3 2026 anchors the migration to a specific quarter [timeline bullet](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1787304049763_5). All five children are dated the same day and carry supporting predicates, so the graph captures a single decision event and its immediate editorial restatements — no dissent, no challenge children, and no subsequent revision yet. The thematic span is narrow: the decision, its two-part rationale, and its timeline. There is nothing here on migration risks, rollback plans, data integrity, or stakeholder pushback.""" ;
